{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgXEeBhSP3zm7Yr3DQnS5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AUj4c2DYTFVXjCtTJFVhrH","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/hc/72kc25qn4z360jql9zgjgl5w0000gn/T/neuron-demo-planner-dg8hqnla/w/specs/feature-1-comment-editing.md","content":"# Feature 1: comment editing\n\nPUT /api/articles/:slug/comments/:id with body {\"comment\":{\"body\":\"...\"}} lets the comment author change the text of their own comment.\n\n## Rules used (name, source)\n- Caller identity from token: code-auth-header.md\n- Token signing and lifetime: code-jwt-settings.md\n- Comment owner is authorId: code-comment-ownership.md\n- Who may edit (author only): code-comment-ownership.md\n- Edit time limit: policy-edit-window.md\n- Edited marker field and migration rule: policy-edited-at-marker.md\n- Current Comment fields: code-comment-model.md\n- Shape of new error bodies: policy-error-response.md\n- Status codes in use today: code-error-shape.md\n- Migration folder layout and apply command: code-migrations.md\n- Migration release checks and undo notes: policy-release-checklist.md\n- Unit test location and run command: code-test-layout.md\n\n## Open points\n- No rule gives a status code for an edit refused for being outside the window, or for a non-author edit. The Builder needs this decided before coding.\n- Error body sources differ for old responses. New responses follow policy-error-response.md.\n\n## Plan\n1. Add the edited marker field as a nullable column with a migration that leaves existing rows unchanged, plus its undo note.\n2. Add an edit path in the article service that checks ownership and the edit window, then updates the body and the marker.\n3. Add unit tests under the services test folder with the mocked database.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cach